🏠 Americans were told our economy depended on the cheap labor created by illegal immigration. At the same time, illegal immigration increased demand for housing, making homeownership more expensive and out of reach for many families.

It's time to put law-abiding American citizens first and make the American Dream attainable again.

@profstonge is a Senior Economist in the Thomas A. Roe Institute for Economic Policy Studies at The Heritage Foundation.

We need to fire the people who are letting museums weaponize against us. Following an executive order calling for a full audit of the National Museum of American History, the Trump administration released a sweeping report outlining thousands of shortcomings in how American history is presented.

Read the full story here: heritage.org/press/heritage-…

@Gundisalvus is the Angeles T. Arredondo E Pluribus Unum Senior Fellow at The Heritage Foundation.
